DateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"算法工程师","OrgId":2363357,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责机器人仿真平台和各类软件工具的开发工作，包括但不限于运动规划，路径规划，设备操作等任务的仿真验证。\n2、参与机器人操作系统的建模与优化，通过仿真手段进行验证和改进机器人的工作流程，确保其在实际应用中的可靠性和高效性。\n3、协助开发团队进行功能验证和测试，通过仿真环境快速迭代和优化算法，缩短开发周期。\n4、负责仿真项目的规划，实施和管理，确保仿真工作的进度和质量符合项目要求。\n5、编写仿真相关文档，包括仿真方案，结果分析报告等。为开发团队提供清晰的技术支持和决策依据","Require":"1、学历背景，本科以上，机器人工程，自动化，机械工程，计算机科学等相关专业\n2、熟练掌握issacsim仿真工具，能够进行复杂的机器人仿真场景搭建、运动仿真机结果分析\n3、熟悉机器人运动学，动力学建模，能够运用相关理论知识进行仿真模型的构建和优化\n4、熟悉了解传感器相关原理，能够仿真器中进行传感器的部署于参数调整\n5、熟练掌握c++，能够进行仿真脚本、算法实现与接口开发","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-14T14:55:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"b7cb41c3-88fe-4bbb-a4ce-3e604292be02","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190807205,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"导航算法工程师","OrgId":2260502,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责完成室外机器人全局/局部路径规划、运动控制等导航算法设计、开发、调试和维护工作；\n2.负责完成室外机器人全覆盖、避障、脱困等业务逻辑、算法的设计、开发、调试和维护工作；\n3.负责完成室外导航算法的仿真、代码优化与移植工作；\n4.负责室外导航算法相关说明文档、技术文档撰写和维护工作。","Require":"1.计算机、自动化等相关专业；\n2.熟练掌握C/C++、Python编程，具有良好的代码规范意识；\n3.熟练掌握A*、D*、JPS、TEB、DWA等路径规划算法；\n4.熟练掌握PID、模糊控制、轨迹跟踪、MPC、LQR等运动控制算法；\n5.具备嵌入式Linux开发和落地经验，具备扎实的计算机和数学基础；\n6.具备独立分析解决问题的能力，有责任心、上进心、热爱研发工作；\n7.有割草机、扫地机、自动驾驶等相关产品落地经验优先；\n8.有大规模代码框架移植、重构经验优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-18T15:58:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"243c4cde-8e16-4826-bba0-9af9e39983dc","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190728929,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外平面设计师","OrgId":75168,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责日常运营的设计工作（官网商城、主KV、活动推广、线上广告素材、社交媒体创意设计等）;\n2.负责日常线下物料设计（包装、海外展会物料等）；\n3.负责amazon、eBay等电商平台的产品图片、A+、listing等平面设计工作；\n4.理解运营及市场需求，并高效沟通协作，提供完整视觉解决方案；",